%%% note
由来: mulet test/mulet/io_test.clj:88 (readCsv-headerLineNumber-test)
testing: headerLineNumber skips comment lines
元の形: io/readCsvWithHeaders の直接呼び出しを DW に書き換え
mulet: 成功
%%% script
%dw 2.0
output application/json
---
read("# comment\n# another\nname,age\nAlice,30", "application/csv", {"headerLineNumber": 2})
%%% output application/json
[
  {
    "# another": "name",
    "column_1": "age"
  },
  {
    "# another": "Alice",
    "column_1": "30"
  }
]
